data: {"id": "97b693230d834dbb-thinking-parallel_evidence-1251", "run_id": "97b693230d834dbb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 本轮工具采集事实\n\n1.  **kubectl_describe (Pod Events)**:\n    *   **关键事件**: `Warning FailedScheduling` - `0/3 nodes are available: persistentvolumeclaim \"unavailable-claim\" not found.`\n    *   该事件从 15m 前开始，重复触发 (5m29s, 10m)。\n    *   状态: **Pending**, 节点: **None**。\n    *   PodScheduled Condition: status=False, reason=Unschedulable。\n\n2.  **kubectl_get_yaml (Pod Spec)**:\n    *   Phase: Pending, nodeName: None。\n    *   Volumes: 定义了一个名为 `input` 的 Volume，类型为 `PersistentVolumeClaim`，`ClaimName: unavailable-cl", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789114699371, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "97b693230d834dbb-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "97b693230d834dbb", "seq": 1252, "ts_ms": 1789114707358, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 45.037, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v03", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/97b693230d834dbb-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "f732080de9c76c7cbfcd44d95e55e6ad282d34ffbb2226a05539b445b838ca3c", "bytes": 2419}, "snapshot_sha256": "0604e1cc117f5988801b826969ba75881b3c231860d0fa9b78ef6d42111491a9"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

